["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">著</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>著作；显著；穿（衣物）；到达；（竞赛）到达终点</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョ・チャク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あらわ.す・いちじる.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">著者</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">著者；作者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">著す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あらわす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">著述；著作；出版</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">著書</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょしょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">著作；作品；著述</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">誌</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>杂志；记录；记载</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雑誌</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ざっし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">杂志；期刊；刊物</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">庫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>仓库；库房</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ・ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷蔵庫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいぞうこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷藏柜；冰箱；冷柜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">金庫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">保险柜；保险箱；现金箱；金库；金库室；存款处；出纳室；金库；财务室；资金提供者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">車庫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゃこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">车库；车棚；（火车、公共汽车等的）车辆段；库棚；电车库</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">刊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>出版；雕刻</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夕刊</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">晚报；夕报</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刊行</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出版；刊行；发行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">季刊</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">季刊；季度出版物</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">像</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>雕像；画像；肖像；形象；图像</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゾウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">想像</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">想象；推测；猜测</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">像</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">图像；雕像；画像；肖像；形象；形态；形状；外观；（物理、数学）像（成像或映射所得的像）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">映像</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えいぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">屏幕上的图像；画面（如电视