ng=\"ja\">そこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">底部；底面；鞋底</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">徹底</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てってい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">彻底</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">根底</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こんてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">根底；根基；基础</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">布</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>布；铺开；分布；传播</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ・ホ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ぬの・し.く・きれ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">財布</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">钱包；皮夹；零钱包</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">布団</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふとん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">日式被褥；铺盖（褥垫与被子）；蒲团；禅坐圆垫</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">布</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぬの</span><span class=\"k-wz\">布料；织物；纺织品；布币（中国古代铲形铜币）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">寺</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>寺庙</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">てら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寺</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">寺院；佛寺</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寺院</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">佛寺；佛教寺院；宗教建筑；教堂；大教堂；清真寺</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">宇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>天；屋檐；屋顶；房屋</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">宇宙</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うちゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">宇宙；宇宙空间；太空</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">巨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>巨大；宏大；伟大</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">巨大</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">巨大；庞大</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">震</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>震动；颤抖；发抖；摇动；使震动</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふる.う・ふる.える・ふる.わせる・ふる.わす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">地震</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地震</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">震える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふるえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">颤抖；发抖；震颤；战栗；哆嗦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">震わせる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふるわせる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">使…颤动；使…震动；使…摇晃；使…振动</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">希</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>希望；请求；稀少；希腊；稀释</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ・ケ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まれ・こいねが.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">希望</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">希望；愿望；抱负；（光明的）前景；期待；展望</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">触</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>接触；触摸；感觉；冲突；宣告</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふ.れる・さわ.る・さわ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">触る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さわる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">触摸；感触；摸；涉及；接近；有害于；妨碍；干扰；刺激</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">触れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">接触；触摸；感受；用…接触；用…触摸；体验；接触；感知；察觉；涉及；提及；言及；提起；提到；抵触；违反（法律、版权等）；侵犯；宣布；公告；散布（谣言等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">感触</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんしょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">触感；手感；质地；感觉；感受；印象</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">依</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>依靠；根据；因此；由于；依赖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ・エ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">依頼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いらい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">请求；委托；委任；依赖；依靠</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">依然</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">依然；仍然；照旧</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">依存</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いぞん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">依存；依赖</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">籍</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>户籍；书籍；登记；会籍</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">国籍</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こくせき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">国籍；国民身份；（船舶、飞机等的）国籍；登记国；船旗国</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">書籍</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょせき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">书籍；出版物</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">戸籍</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こせき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">户籍；户口簿；人口普查</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">汚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>弄脏；玷污；污辱；污染；肮脏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">けが.す・けが.れる・けが.らわしい・よご.す・よご.れる・きたな.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">汚い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きたない</span><span class=\"k-wz\">肮脏；污秽；不洁；凌乱；邋遢；字迹潦草；下流；粗俗；不雅；卑鄙；下作；阴险；小气；贪心；吝啬</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">汚れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よごれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变脏；弄脏；蒙垢；堕落；失贞</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">汚染</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">污染；污秽</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">枚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>薄平物品的计数单位</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マイ・バイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">枚数</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まいすう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">张数；枚数；（相扑选手等级排名中的）胜负差</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">枚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">张；枚；块（用于薄片状物品，如纸张、盘子、硬币等）；份（用于饺子或荞麦面）；（相扑）排位名次的量词；名（用于特定等级的相扑力士）；块；片（用于田地或稻田）；名（用于轿夫）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">複</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>重复；双重；复合；多重</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">複雑</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくざつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">复杂</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">複写</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">复写；复印；复制</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">複数</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくすう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">复数；多个；复数（语法数）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">郵</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>邮件；驿站</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">郵便局</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうびんきょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邮便局；邮局</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">郵便</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうびん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邮政服务；邮件服务；邮件；邮递；邮件；邮递物品</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">郵送</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邮寄；邮送；邮递</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">仲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>中介；关系</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仲</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">关系；人际</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仲間</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なかま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">伙伴；同伴；朋友；伙计；战友；搭档；同事；同僚；群体；集团；圈子；帮派；同类；同族；同级</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仲直り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なかなおり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">和好；讲和；重归于好；化解纠纷</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">栄</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>繁荣；荣耀；光辉；繁盛；昌盛</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エイ・ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さか.える・は.え・-ば.え・は.える・え</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">栄養</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えいよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">营养；营养成分</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">繁栄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんえい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">繁荣；兴盛；昌盛</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">栄える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さかえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">繁荣；昌盛；兴盛</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">札</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>标签；纸币；票据；投标；布告牌</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふだ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">札</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纸币；钞票；纸钞</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">改札</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">检票；查票；检票口；检票闸口</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">名札</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なふだ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">名牌；名签；标签</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">板</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>木板；平板；金属板；舞台</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハン・バン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いた</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">板</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いた</span><span class=\"k-wz\">板；木板；金属板；玻璃板；玻璃窗格；石板；砧板；菜板；（高级日料）厨师；料理人；舞台；戏台</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">黒板</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こくばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">黑板</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">看板</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">招牌；标牌；广告牌；门牌；吸引力；卖点；代表人物；门面；商号声誉；名号；外观；样子；门面；打烊；营业结束时间</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">骨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>骨头；骨架；遗骨；关键</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほね</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">骨</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">诀窍；技巧；窍门；秘诀；门道；骨骼；骨头；骨灰；遗骨</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">骨折</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こっせつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">骨折</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">露骨</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろこつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公开；不隐瞒；毫不掩饰；赤裸裸；坦率；粗俗；下流；猥亵；粗鲁</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">届</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>送达；到达；报告；通知；转交</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とど.ける・-とど.け・とど.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">届ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とどける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">递送；转交；发送；报告；通知；报备；登记</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">届く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とどく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">送到；到达</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">届け</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とどけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">报告；通知；登记</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">巻</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>卷（卷轴）；卷（书籍册数）；卷（量词）；卷起；缠绕</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン・ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ま.く・まき・ま.き</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">寝巻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ねまき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">睡衣；睡袍；睡眠服</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">巻く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缠绕；卷起；包裹；戴（头巾、围巾等）；包住；笼罩；迂回；绕过；联句；提前（三小时等）；提前进行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">巻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">卷；卷轴；（钟表等的）上弦；卷紧；卷；册；加速；提速；（日式木屐的）鞋跟</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">燃</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>燃烧；点燃；烧毁；发光；发亮</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ネン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">も.える・も.やす・も.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">燃える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">燃烧；着火；激情高涨</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">燃やす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もやす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">燃烧；点燃；燃烧；激昂</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">燃焼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ねんしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">燃烧；燃烧作用；竭尽全力；奋力；尽力</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">跡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>痕迹；足迹；遗迹；印记</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み