ana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">停车；泊车</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">弱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>弱；虚弱；削弱；不擅长；略少于</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジャク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よわ.い・よわ.る・よわ.まる・よわ.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">弱い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よわい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">弱；虚弱；脆弱；柔弱；不熟练；淡（酒）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">弱点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゃくてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">弱点；薄弱环节；不足之处；缺陷；瑕疵；软肋；敏感点</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">弱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">略少于；略不足；略低于；弱；弱者；低档；（震度）弱；偏弱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">紹</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>介绍；继承</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">紹介</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">介绍；引见；推荐；展示</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">雇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>雇佣；雇用</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やと.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雇う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">雇用；聘用；雇佣；包租（车、船等）；租用（车、船等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雇用</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">雇用；雇佣；聘用</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">替</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>交换；替代；代替；备用；替换</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">か.える・か.え-・か.わる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">取り替える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とりかえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">交换；互换；掉换；兑换；替换；更换；代替</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">両替</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょうがえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">兑换；换钱</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">替える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">替换；转换；改变；交换；互换；更新；替代（人员、职员、选手等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">預</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>寄存；委托；保管；托付</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あず.ける・あず.かる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">預ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あずける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">托付；寄存；委托；存放；委托；交由；让……决定；靠；倚；倚靠；把身体靠在……上</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">預かる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あずかる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">保管；照看；代为看管；保存；被委托；被赋予责任；被委以重任；暂缓（宣布）；保留（判断）；留待决定；自行承担；自己处理</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">預金</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よきん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">存款；银行账户</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">焼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>烧；烤；烘；焙；燃烧</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">や.く・や.き・や.き-・-や.き・や.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">焼く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">烧；焚烧；烤；炙烤；烘烤；烧烤；加热；热；烧制；烧成；烧窑；晒黑；晒伤；冲洗（照片）；刻录（光盘）；妒忌；嫉妒；眼红</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">焼ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">燃烧；烧毁；化为灰烬；烤熟；烤透；熟透；晒黑；晒伤；（被日光）晒褪色；（天空）泛红；（夕阳映照下）呈红色；（被太阳）晒热；变烫；嫉妒；眼红</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">燃焼</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ねんしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">燃烧；燃烧作用；竭尽全力；奋力；尽力</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">簡</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>简单；简洁；简略；书信</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン・ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">えら.ぶ・ふだ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">簡単</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんたん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">简单；容易；不复杂；简短；简略；简便</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">簡易</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">简单；简化；容易；朴素</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">簡潔</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんけつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">简洁；简明；扼要；紧凑</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">章</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>徽章；章节；作品；诗歌；图案</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">文章</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぶんしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">文章；作文；文笔；写作风格；句子</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">章</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">章；节；篇；奖章；徽章；勋章</span></li></ul></div></li>"]